{
  "description": "The iCal feed connector: read-only Google Calendar through the calendar's \"Secret address in iCal format\" (no OAuth, no Google Cloud project) into the Library (docs/spec/calendar-ical.md). Rows: POST and GET /kb/calendar-ical/sources, DELETE /kb/calendar-ical/sources/:id, POST /kb/calendar-ical/sync, POST /kb/calendar-ical/options. Served by extension/routes/calendar-ical.mjs, dispatched from extension/routes/router.mjs; always on. Token-protected and user-scoped (another user's source id answers 404 ICAL_NOT_FOUND). The feed URL is a bearer secret: it is write-only (request body of POST sources only), is stored only in the per-user vault (ical.src.<id>.url) and appears in no response, log, audit row or error. Error codes: ICAL_URL_INVALID and ICAL_HOST_NOT_ALLOWED (400), ICAL_NOT_FOUND (404), ICAL_DUPLICATE, ICAL_TOO_MANY_SOURCES, ICAL_SYNC_RUNNING, ICAL_FEED_REVOKED (409), ICAL_RATE_LIMITED (429), ICAL_FETCH_FAILED, ICAL_TOO_LARGE, ICAL_PARSE_FAILED (502), plus VALIDATION_FAILED (400) and INTERNAL (500). Fixtures are the real handler's responses (in-process, tests/ical-routes.test.mjs with ICAL_DUMP_FIXTURES) with the feed host answered by recorded ICS fixtures under extension/tests/fixtures/ical; no fixture reached a real host. Source ids and timestamps are normalised to example values and the fake token to private-EXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLE. The 400 for a malformed JSON body is not declared per route, as SCHEMA.md says.",
  "$defs": {
    "Source": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "sourceId": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "calendarIdPrefix": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "first characters of the calendar id (a non-secret hint), empty for an operator-added host"
        },
        "host": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "status": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "idle",
            "error",
            "revoked"
          ],
          "description": "last run outcome; revoked = the secret address no longer works (404 or 410)"
        },
        "lastRunAt": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "lastError": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "a stable code, never a response body"
        },
        "options": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "daysBack": {
              "type": "integer",
              "description": "0 to 365, default 30"
            },
            "daysAhead": {
              "type": "integer",
              "description": "0 to 730, default 90"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "endpoints": {
    "POST /kb/calendar-ical/sources": {
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "name": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "url": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "the secret iCal address (https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/<id>/private-<token>/basic.ics, webcal:// accepted). Write-only: never returned."
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "sourceId": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "name": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "nameOnly": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "enum": [
                true
              ],
              "description": "always true: only the label comes back, never the address"
            },
            "calendarIdPrefix": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "host": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "400": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "409": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    },
    "GET /kb/calendar-ical/sources": {
      "request": {},
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "sources": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Source"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DELETE /kb/calendar-ical/sources/:id": {
      "request": {
        "params": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "id"
          ]
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "ok": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "purgedSources": {
              "type": "integer",
              "description": "cached note rows removed"
            }
          }
        },
        "400": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "404": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    },
    "POST /kb/calendar-ical/sync": {
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "sourceId": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "sourceId": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "status": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "ok",
                "unchanged",
                "not_modified"
              ],
              "description": "unchanged = same body as the last run; not_modified = the host answered 304"
            },
            "events": {
              "type": "integer",
              "description": "VEVENT components read"
            },
            "instances": {
              "type": "integer",
              "description": "event instances written inside the window"
            },
            "cancelled": {
              "type": "integer",
              "description": "cancelled events or occurrences removed by exact ref"
            },
            "removed": {
              "type": "integer",
              "description": "rows swept because the feed no longer has them (only after a complete pass)"
            },
            "truncated": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "a cap or budget stopped the pass; nothing is swept then"
            },
            "warnings": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "stable codes, e.g. tz_unknown, floating, rrule_subdaily, rrule_unsupported, rrule_invalid, instance_cap, budget_exhausted, oversized_property, malformed_line, nested_vcalendar"
            }
          }
        },
        "400": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "409": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "429": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "502": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    },
    "POST /kb/calendar-ical/options": {
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "sourceId": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "options": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "daysBack": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "description": "0 to 365, default 30"
                },
                "daysAhead": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "description": "0 to 730, default 90"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "ok": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "options": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "daysBack": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "description": "0 to 365, default 30"
                },
                "daysAhead": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "description": "0 to 730, default 90"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "400": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        },
        "404": {
          "$ref": "_common#/$defs/Error"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
